WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.277
On Sunday, you know exactly who to trust.

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:11.228
On Monday, the pipe bursts, and you’re scrolling through strangers.

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:15.856
Meet Jubilee.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:18.783
Toronto’s Christian businesses, all in one place.

00:00:22.146 --> 00:00:24.257
Every business is verified by the Jubilee team.

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:27.422
Your money stays in the community. And it’s free to join.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:33.029
Shop Christian makers: Bibles, gifts, apparel and fresh flowers.

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:39.578
Hire the advisors and trades your church already recommends,

00:00:39.766 --> 00:00:40.884
and book in a tap.

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:47.089
Own a business? Your church family is looking for you.

00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:53.700
Create your page, get verified by our team,

00:00:53.700 --> 00:00:55.433
and welcome customers who already trust you.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:01.223
Jubilee. Your community is open for business.
